SUMMARY:MoB Teens: Sunday Fun-day Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Paint\, play and make your mark! A creative and colourful works
 hop just for teens\, led by Artist in Residence Sunday Jemmott. Join us fo
 r an afternoon of experimentation – mix paint\, doodles\, scribbles and 
 collage to create an artwork that’s completely your own. Layer\, splash 
 and play with texture in a relaxed workshop where there are no rules\, jus
 t plenty of room to explore. Sunday will share insights into her creative 
 practice and help guide teens as they bring their ideas to life. Leave wit
 h a one-of-a-kind artwork and a head full of colourful inspiration! Museum
  of Brisbane is Brisbane City Council’s leading history and art museum w
 here you can experience our city’s vibrant culture.
LOCATION:Museum of Brisbane\, Brisbane City\, Museum of Brisbane\, Brisbane
  City Hall\, 64 Adelaide Street\, Brisbane City
